<title>FRANCE: Total details 1996 sales figures.</title>
<headline>Total details 1996 sales figures.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     176,577    vs  135,829</p>
<p>    -- upstream				   12,160    vs    9,453</p>
<p>    -- downstream				139,441    vs  104,421</p>
<p>    -- chemicals				  24,568    vs   21,629</p>
<p>    -- holding					 408    vs	326</p>
<p>NOTE - Total issued preliminary sales and profit figures on January 29. It said the 30 percent sales rise was partly due to favourable circumstances such as the Brent price and the dollar.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
